      "why_it_matters": "CA-013 Call 2's no-staging-step property is the stated reason for gating catdef.org pushes. CA-016's runtime-fetch mechanism gives catdef-spec/renderer/ the same property, with no catdef.org deploy involved at all. Both briefs name catdef.org only.",
